    "encoding_note": "InfiniBand uses 8b/10b line coding for SDR/DDR/QDR and 64b/66b for FDR/EDR/HDR, with PAM4 modulation at HDR/NDR. Data integrity is provided by a 16-bit Variant CRC (per hop) and a 32-bit Invariant CRC (end-to-end), not by the line code."
